## Sidebar navigation (role + preset lens)

Built by [clinic-nav.ts](../../src/domain/nav/clinic-nav.ts) → [ClinicOpsShell.tsx](../../src/components/ClinicOpsShell.tsx).

| Group | Visibility | Routes |
|-------|------------|--------|
| Flat top | all authenticated | `/` (Home — full-width; shared date toolbar; for owner/`canViewExecutive`, `ExecutiveDashboard` first block above ops summary), `/patients` |
| Front desk | `RECEPTION` (+ admin/owner) | `/appointments` (practitioner day matrix), `/reception/queue`, `/cashier` |
| Clinical | `DOCTOR` / `NURSE` (+ admin/owner) | `/doctor` (DOCTOR), `/nurse` (NURSE), `/lab-orders` |
| Sanatorium | preset `sanatorium_clinical` | `/sanatorium` (RECEPTION, DOCTOR), `/sanatorium/resources` (RECEPTION) |
| Inpatient | preset `inpatient_day` | `/inpatient`, `/inpatient/census`, `/admin/wards` (admin-only) |
| Wellness | preset `wellness` | placeholder (no routes yet — section auto-hides) |
| Catalogs | admin/owner | `/admin/catalog` (service prices), `/admin/diagnostic-catalog` (modalities/services/analytes/**favorites** tab), `/admin/templates` |
| Rules & data | admin/owner | `/admin/procedure-rules`, `/admin/lis-profiles`, `/admin/master-data` |
| Platform | admin/owner | `/admin/audit`, `/admin/settings` |

Internal: `GET/POST /api/internal/v1/organization/bind` (orch Sync bindings; ADR satellite-organization-bind); `POST /api/internal/v1/procedure-validate`.

Removed screens: `/executive` (merged into Home for owners), `/admin/catalog-favorites` (now a tab on `/admin/diagnostic-catalog`). Both routes deleted — no redirect.

**List UX (CLI-37):** `EraListFilterBar` = instant filters (no Apply; Reset inline; text search `useDebouncedValue` 300ms). Tables: name/title column first; row actions = Lucide icons + `TABLE_ROW_ICON_BTN_CLASS`. Home `/` full-width with one shared date for executive + ops.

`seesAll` = `canViewClinicAdmin || isPlatformSuperAdmin`. Nav is presentational; middleware + route guards remain authoritative.

## Ops (preset `outpatient`)

| Route | API |
|-------|-----|
| `/` | Shared date toolbar + `GET /api/ops/day-summary?date=`; owners also get `ExecutiveDashboard` (`GET /api/executive/summary`) as first block; full-width (no content `max-w-*`) |
| `/appointments` | `/api/appointments` (optional resourceId/roomCode); PATCH reschedule + conflict |
| `/patients` | `/api/patients` — paginated list (`q`, sex, blood, MDM, age) + register; modal card via `PatientCardModal` |
| `/patients/[id]` | `/api/patients/[id]` PATCH (anamnesis required on demographics); shared `PatientCardBody` |
| `/api/mdm/person-lookup` | POST — MDM resolve prefill (session) |
| `/api/mdm/person-identifiers` | GET — identifier types for linked `globalPersonId` |
| `/api/mdm/person-merge` | POST — foreigner → citizen merge |
| `/appointments` | Practitioner **day matrix** (`GET /api/appointments/calendar`); create/reschedule/check-in/cancel. CLI-36: off-shift slots `blocked` (offShift); create + reschedule reject off-shift (409) |
| `/lab-orders` | `GET /api/lab-orders` (paged `{data,total,page,pageSize}`; status/criticalOnly/modality/patientRefId/dateFrom/dateTo filters; items+results+modality include), `/api/diagnostic-catalog` (picker + favorites sort); row opens **LabOrderWorkflowModal** |
| `/lab-orders/[id]` | Redirect → `/lab-orders?order=` + same modal (`GET /api/lab-orders/[id]`, collect/results/publish/complete) |
| `/reception/queue` | `/api/queue/*` |
| `/doctor`, `/nurse` | role-guarded |
| `/cashier` | Queue / history / over-quota tabs; shift open+close (X/Z); settle modal by channel (`LOCAL` / `HOTEL_FOLIO` / `SETTLEMENT_HUB`); `GET /api/cashier/queue`, `…/shifts/current`, `…/shifts/[id]/close|report`, `…/bills/[visitId]` (+ settle), `…/receipts` (+ void/reprint), `…/over-quota` (+ settle); hub banner informational |
| Executive (`GET /api/executive/summary?date=&practitionerId=`) | client `ExecutiveDashboard`; OrgOwner (`canViewExecutive`); rendered on Home `/` (no standalone `/executive` route) |

## Preset `sanatorium_clinical`

| Route | API |
|-------|-----|
| `/sanatorium` | Table of open courses (`EraListFilterBar` + row actions: chart / procedures / patient modal); walk-in modal (sex required M/F, DatePicker, program select, lab catalog); `/api/sanatorium/episodes`, `GET /api/sanatorium/program-templates`, `POST ?action=complete-checkup` |
| `/nurse` | Agenda (prev→EOD) + kanban; check-in while window open (endsAt +gap if next free); no nurse No-show; `GET /api/procedures?mine=1` |
| `/sanatorium/resources` | Location **day matrix board** (`ResourceDayMatrix`) + optional **fullscreen** overlay; horizon (rest/+1h/+3h) + patient filter; `GET …/calendar` uses Tenant working hours; DnD / move / cancel |

