| Route | API |
|-------|-----|
| `/admin/master-data` | `/api/admin/practitioners` (**403 POST** when `cp_workforce`; ops PATCH specialty/slots); `GET /api/admin/workforce-policy`; rooms, resources (PATCH roomId); practitioners/[id]/skills GET/PUT; practitioners/[id]/**schedule** GET/PUT (CLI-36 shift rules + exceptions, replace-all, audited); **Shifts** modal; procedure-types (+requirements, _count.skills); procedure-types/[id]/requirements GET/PUT; link → `/admin/wards`; hire → orchestrator `/workspace/workforce` |
| `/admin/wards` | `/api/admin/wards`, `/api/admin/wards/[id]`, `/api/admin/beds/[id]` (modal CRUD) |
