| `/admin/templates` | `/api/admin/clinical-templates`, program-templates (+ PATCH `[id]`) — seed pack: `prisma/seed-data/diagnostic-lab-catalog.json` ([DIAGNOSTIC_AND_LAB_CATALOG](../../doc/DIAGNOSTIC_AND_LAB_CATALOG.md)) |
